## Deployment Topology (if productised)

```
[Household User]
      │
      ▼
[Web / Mobile Client]  ──►  [Plan API — stateless REST]
                                      │
                              [Plan Store — Postgres]
                                      │
                              [Shopping List Materialiser]
                                      │
                              [Allergen Disclosure Engine]
```

For the **non-software MVP**, this collapses to: one Google Sheet (plan store + shopping list materialiser) and one Google Doc (formatted output). No cloud deployment required. (assumed)

---

## Observability

| Signal | Metric | Alert Threshold |
|---|---|---|
| Budget compliance | totalEstimatedCostUSD | > $120 blocks APPROVED status |
| Plan completeness | meals.length | < 7 blocks APPROVED status |
| Allergen coverage | allergensPresent populated | Missing field = validation warning |
| Shopping list coverage | items with no cost estimate | Any $0 non-pantry item = review flag |

---

## Testing Strategy

### Unit Tests (if productised)
- `validatePlan()` with a compliant plan → 0 errors
- `validatePlan()` with total = $121 → budget error
- `validatePlan()` with 6 meals → missing-day error
- `validatePlan()` with duplicate recipe names → distinctness error
- `ShoppingListMaterialiser` deduplicates same ingredient across 2 meals

### Manual QA Checklist (non-software MVP)
- [ ] All 7 days assigned a meal
- [ ] No two meals share the same recipe name
- [ ] Sum of ingredient costs ≤ $120
- [ ] Every non-pantry ingredient appears on the shopping list
- [ ] Allergen flags reviewed with household
- [ ] Household decision-maker has signed off

---

## Threat Model Summary

| Threat | Likelihood | Impact | Mitigation |
|---|---|---|---|
| Cost estimate inaccuracy (regional price variance) | High | Medium | Use conservative (high) estimates; target $110 internal ceiling with $10 buffer |
| Allergen undisclosed (pantry item contains allergen) | Medium | High | Review pantry staples list for hidden allergens before finalising |
| Recipe duplication (similar meals miscategorised as distinct) | Low | Low | Distinctness check in BLUE phase |
| Budget overrun at checkout (estimate ≠ actual price) | Medium | Medium | $10 buffer recommended; buy store-brand equivalents |
| Incomplete shopping list (ingredient missed) | Low | Medium | Cross-reference each recipe ingredient list line-by-line in BLUE phase |

